# Packages of the workspace environment (/opt/rsdat/venv): JupyterLab, the notebook client,
# the Dask scheduler and the Prefect server. Includes everything the workers have
# (requirements.txt), so the shared packages resolve to one version.
#
# After changing this file or requirements.txt, run worker-image/lock.sh: it updates
# workspace.lock and requirements.lock (exact versions of all packages, also indirect ones),
# which the playbook and the worker image install.
-r requirements.txt
dask-jobqueue==0.9.0
jupyterlab==4.6.4
dask-labextension==7.0.0
jupyterlab-git==0.55.0
jupyter-server-proxy
# SLURM-CLI-API-Proxy client (sbatch/squeue/scancel/... over the Slurm REST API); the lock pins
# the commit. Pin to a tag once the fixes are merged upstream.
slurm-api-cli-proxy @ git+https://github.com/t1mk1k/SLURM-CLI-API-Proxy-client.git@fix/install-scancel-dask
